    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a new [binding deployment policy](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for Meridian, mandating a signed release manifest for all artifacts. This directive, framed as a [settled decision](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3), applies across both [staging and production environments](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4). Fairweather justifies this shift by citing [past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), specifically the unauthorized entry of unsigned artifacts into staging last quarter. The policy is presented with clear [individual ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5), marking a transition from reactive observation to enforced procedural control.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "While the policy is formal and authoritative, the underlying motivation is grounded in a specific, reactive frustration with past operational failures." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "shifts between technical precision and plain-spoken justification" ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
